{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19256","headline":"送曹璩归越中旧隐诗 · 刘禹锡","name":"送曹璩归越中旧隐诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"行尽潇湘万里余，少逢知己忆吾庐。\n数间茅屋闲临水，一盏秋灯夜读书。\n地远何当随计吏，策成终自诣公车。\n剡中若问连州事，唯有千山画不如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19256.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19256","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}